  "command_record_note": "The driver first passed compact segments/storage and compact source suites, then encountered a stale test expecting i386 SS refusal. After updating that expectation, the six targets were rebuilt and the remaining four suites passed. The commands files retain this last stage; all six XML reports are retained. Compiled production sources were unchanged throughout these checks.",
